  <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Thulla Online</a> &rsaquo; How to Play Thulla Online</p>
  <h1>How to Play Thulla Online</h1>
  <p class="lead">Thulla is a classic trick-taking card game where the goal is simple: get rid of all your cards before everyone else. Here is how to play Thulla online with friends, from opening a room to winning your first game.</p>

  <h2>What you need</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A phone, tablet or computer with a modern browser, or the free Thulla app on Android or iOS.</li>
    <li>A few friends, or other players to join your room.</li>
    <li>Landscape orientation on a phone gives the best view of your cards.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Step 1: Open the game</h2>
  <p>Go to <a href="/">thulla.online</a> and tap <strong>Play Instantly</strong>. The game opens full screen in your browser and nothing needs to be installed. If you prefer, install the app from Google Play or the App Store.</p>

  <h2>Step 2: Create or join a room</h2>
  <p>Create a new room to host your own game, or join an existing one. Every room has a short room code.</p>

  <h2>Step 3: Invite your friends</h2>
  <p>Share the room link on WhatsApp, Discord or any chat app. When a friend opens the link, the room code is filled in and they can join in one tap, either in the browser or in the app.</p>

  <h2>Step 4: Play your cards</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>The cards are dealt among all the players.</li>
    <li>On your turn, play a card of the same suit that was led.</li>
    <li>If you have no card of that suit, you can play any other card.</li>
    <li>When a round ends, either the cards are discarded or one player picks them up. See the <a href="/rules">full rules</a> for exactly how this works.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Step 5: Win the game</h2>
  <p>Keep playing rounds until you have no cards left. Players leave the game as they run out of cards, and the last player still holding cards is the Thulla.</p>

  <div class="box">
    <h2>Beginner tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Pay attention to which suits have already been played. It tells you what your opponents can still follow with.</li>
      <li>Try not to be stuck with too many high cards near the end, because high cards are the ones that take the pile.</li>
      <li>When you cannot follow suit, use the chance to get rid of a dangerous high card.</li>
      <li>Use voice chat to play with friends, or just to find a game.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

